    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/writing/method.json",
      "locator": "/tasks/4/result_rule",
      "value": "A correct text delta and unchanged root version text cannot yield an overall writing pass with missing native evidence. Report separate artifact/text, answer, grounding, reader-fidelity and native outcomes; false/unsupported extras or contradictions require independent claim adjudication.",
