    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
      "locator": "L32",
      "value": "| Dimension | Required unit and correct outcome | Other item outcomes |",
      "value_sha256": "5afc31460823151361a4dc4e46a18256a6c2262226ba30647a3085efbe8c4691"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
      "locator": "L33",
      "value": "|---|---|---|",
      "value_sha256": "c18ce6a3bdd292c83356833570495b8d8021e2483de3023bc28fd7e7bdbbcf4c"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
      "locator": "L34",
      "value": "| Reading fidelity | Each fixed required reader observation matches its independently checked native reference, including required types, properties and relations under declared tolerances. | Partially represented compound content is partial; a conflicting value/relation is incorrect; absent content is missing. Unsupported access, inaccessible diagrams, tool errors and unverified native references retain their explicit outcomes and never earn correct credit. |",
      "value_sha256": "4eeb01e81f5100d8699a00b9514e2796f4f9166284de77efd705b4e09fc2e2f3"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
      "locator": "L35",
      "value": "| Answer correctness | Each required answer claim matches an independently established expected claim under its conditions and tolerances. | Incomplete content is partial; false claims or contradictions are incorrect; omitted claims are missing; claims without sufficient independent evidence are unverified. An unsupported-case declaration remains unsupported, not correct. |",
      "value_sha256": "5d90afbf72502069bb2ff0802a6feee71c42b6ed762e79aabcd41fbc2176d742"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
      "locator": "L36",
      "value": "| Source grounding | Each required answer claim has resolvable original-artifact citations supporting its complete asserted content and conditions. | Support for only part is partial; a wrong or non-supporting citation is incorrect; absent claims/citations are missing; inaccessible evidence is unverified. A correct answer with a wrong citation is incorrect in grounding independently of correctness. |",
      "value_sha256": "ae4009472ce80944c72814e3f34805da2cdf60e3ab4b28bd1c6c67c512c78f85"
    },
    {
      "path": "benchmark/protocol.md",
